    "44c7bbbf-3d4e-4133-8562-fcb72d051e75": {
      "start": 7237,
      "end": 8162,
      "txt": "He said he was out there walking his dog along the bluffs above El Matador, right? And he looks down at the beach at that huge rock, you know, the one that's separated from the mainland, right where the ocean meets the shore. His words, looks like a, like a \"mythic sea creature.\" You know that one?",
      "characterId": "bcc41bd8-dc8c-4d99-a09c-4612981edd3e",
      "segments": [],
      "aux": {},
      "dubAnnotations": {
        "types": [],
